# RevOps UI is the source of truth

Take browser UI from `https://github.com/samihan-narayankeri-sp/project-gru-revops-poc` **`main`**.

Do not keep or revive the older Marketing Minion shell: dual rails, workbench, projects, compare, starters, motion.js, composer task chips, or marketing-only dialogs.

Allowed changes on copied files:

- Bob → James
- `/static/assets/bob.png` → `/static/james.png`
- `/api/chat` still hits the marketing orchestrator

Filter chrome stays the RevOps shape: geo, boat, opp, report, size, stage, time. Map those onto marketing data in Python, not in a new UI.

Pages: `/` landing, `/dashboard` (and `/app`) dashboard, `/chat` workspace.
